      "message": "If we use the Vulkan memory model, I believe we also need to add the `NonPrivatePointer` operand to all `OpLoad` and `OpStore` instructions that touch read-write `storage` and `workgroup` memory, and `NonPrivateTexel` to `OpImageRead` and `OpImageWrite` instructions that touch read-write storage images.\n\nIt\u0027d be really nice if we had a good test somewhere that would fail if we forget to emit these operands, but that might be hard...",
